rounding-fin-212-08d3cd5986", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 375336, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01P7GS7scpCum2VDanXC3rgc", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 376927, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "The nightly failure is fixed and PR #101 is open against main, with alex requested as reviewer.\n\n- **Cause:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, but its docstring and FIN-212 call for banker's rounding.\n- **Fix:** Switched the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` on branch `fix/banker-rounding-fin-212` (commit 08d3cd5986). The change is one import and one argument.\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` passed on that commit.\n- **PR:** https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\nI did not merge the PR. Merging into main needs approval from a code owner, so that step is still open.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by reading the test and the source file to see what's expected.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01FTn7ekXbnNFY3XwUGvTDQN", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_011vpwAuwjdjYUgLwex9yNWm", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The bug is clear: `round_money` uses `ROUND_HALF_UP`, but its docstring and FIN-212 call for `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. Both test assertions hold under half-even (2.675 \u2192 2.68, 2.665 \u2192 2.66). I'll create a branch and commit the one-line fix.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01H7RWpvR2Zimh95NVK6k6xE", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input":